<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>damned</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">Miguel</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">Wildheart (Deluxe Version)</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">2ZCe5vjgNDAmoWe73C46nc</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:00.000" end="00:05.060">Damned</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:05.060" end="00:08.410" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:08.410" end="00:11.360" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:11.360" end="00:15.250">I pled my case with the Gods, woman</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:15.250" end="00:19.200">Just place your sweet shackles on my mind</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:19.200" end="00:24.050">I'm down to wild notions of waiting slow</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:24.050" end="00:27.500">No mercy, no pardon for stolen time</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:27.500" end="00:29.000" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:28.550" end="00:30.530">When the gavel hit the stand</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:30.530" end="00:32.730">I'm damned for loving you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:32.730" end="00:34.950">Two palm trees in the sand</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:34.950" end="00:38.290">I'm damned for loving you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:38.290" end="00:43.910">We set fire to these skies for our love and I'd do it all again</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:43.910" end="00:46.130">I'm damned for loving you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:46.130" end="00:54.130" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:56.160" end="01:00.050">Curse the stars now there's no escape</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:00.050" end="01:04.280">Cause your walls are my favorite vice</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:04.280" end="01:08.330">Two hearts committed to hopeless fate</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:08.330" end="01:12.280">I'd serve my life sentence a thousand times, woman</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:12.280" end="01:13.780" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:13.060" end="01:15.070">When the gavel hit the stand</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:15.070" end="01:17.290">I'm damned for loving you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:17.290" end="01:19.380">Two palm trees in the sand</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:19.380" end="01:22.540">I'm damned for loving you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:22.540" end="01:29.200">We set fire to these skies for our love and I'd do it all again</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:29.200" end="01:30.700">Cause I'm damned for loving you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:30.690" end="01:38.690" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:39.700" end="01:41.660">When the gavel hit the stand</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:41.660" end="01:44.040">I'm damned for loving you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:44.040" end="01:46.100">Two palm trees in the sand</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:46.100" end="01:49.060">I'm damned for loving you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:49.060" end="01:54.880">We set fire to these skies for our love and I'd do it all again</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:54.880" end="01:56.790">I'm damned for loving you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:56.790" end="01:58.290" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:57.260" end="02:01.020">Like you've owned my love in every life before</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:01.020" end="02:05.120">And every life I live, all my life searching for</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:05.120" end="02:09.590">It's like you've owned my love in every life before</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:09.590" end="02:13.560">And every life I live, all my life searching for</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:13.560" end="02:15.200" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:15.200" end="02:18.730">When the gavel hit the stand</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:18.730" end="02:20.230">I'm damned for loving you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:19.720" end="02:21.710">Two palm trees in the sand</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:21.710" end="02:24.190">I'm damned for loving you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:24.190" end="02:27.190">We set fire to these skies for our love and I'd do it all again</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:27.190" end="02:28.840">Cause I'm damned for loving you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:28.840" end="02:31.060" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:31.060" end="02:32.840">When the gavel hit the stand</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:32.840" end="02:34.350" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Just like it's always been)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:34.350" end="02:35.850">I'm damned for loving you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:35.500" end="02:39.130">Two palm trees in the sand</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:39.130" end="02:40.670" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Can't get away from it)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:40.670" end="02:42.170">I'm damned for loving you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:41.750" end="02:48.670">We set fire to these skies for our love and I'd do it all again</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:48.670" end="02:50.680">Cause I'm damned for loving you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:50.680" end="02:58.680" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:06.670" end="03:10.670">I'm damned for loving you</p></div></body></tt>